OL,3,GNEWSANo bathing warning at beach linked
OL,4,Ato blue brook
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials have asked people not to swim
OL,7,Fat a beach following a pollution
OL,8,Fincident which has turned a brook
OL,9,Fbright blue.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency said it was
OL,12,Fadvising against entering the water at
OL,13,FExmouth beach and nearby swimming spots
OL,14,Funtil further notice.
OL,16,FIt comes after a pollution incident at
OL,17,FLittleham Brook in the town which left
OL,18,Fthe water blue.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
