OL,3,GNEWSANo bathing warning at beach linked
OL,4,Ato blue brook
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Environment Agency spokesperson said
OL,7,Fit was continuing its investigation and
OL,8,Fasked anyone with information about the
OL,9,Fincident to get in touch.
